1
00:00:00,729 --> 00:00:03,269
(Leonard:)Wolowitz sent his in two days ago.

2
00:00:04,332 --> 00:00:07,282
(Penny:)-Really, let it go.
-Look, maybe it is a long shot,

3
00:00:07,435 --> 00:00:09,505
(Leonard:)but sometimes long shots happen.

4
00:00:09,671 --> 00:00:13,141
(Leonard:)Luke Skywalker was only given one
chance to destroy the Death Star.

5
00:00:13,308 --> 00:00:15,808
(Leonard:)He had to get a torpedo
into an exhaust port

6
00:00:15,977 --> 00:00:19,447
(Leonard:)that was only two meters wide,
but with the help of The Force, he--

7
00:00:19,614 --> 00:00:22,654
(Leonard:)Wow, I can feel you
hating me right now.

8
00:00:26,354 --> 00:00:29,134
(Stuart:)How about that lady
in the sweat suit, speed-walking?

9
00:00:29,291 --> 00:00:31,791
(Raj:)Yeah, she seems friendly
and easy to...

10
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:33,700
(Raj:)Never mind, she's gone.

11
00:00:34,929 --> 00:00:38,379
(Raj:)Maybe talking
to people is too hard.

12
00:00:39,434 --> 00:00:43,384
(Stuart:)We could go over to that department
store, practice on the mannequins.

13
00:00:43,538 --> 00:00:45,378
(Penny:)I don't know.
They're dressed very stylishly.

14
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:47,610
(Raj:)They're probably stuck-up.

15
00:00:50,011 --> 00:00:51,491
(Raj:)This is ridiculous.

16
00:00:51,646 --> 00:01:00,026
(Raj:)The next person that walks by,
no matter who it is, they're the one.

